    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap for Early Access</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/424e19a18fefa2912370e1acf3f1694e.avif?t=1755238701\" width=616 height=516 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Netherworld Covenant</strong> is a <i>dark fantasy 3D isometric action roguelike</i> centered on <i>precision combat</i> and <i>Soul Companion</i> powers to deliver a hardcore, strategically rich experience. Control the survivor of a catastrophic disaster, wielding the Nether Lantern\u2014a forbidden artifact bridging the mortal realm and the netherworld\u2014to forge pacts with the souls of deceased allies. Venture into procedurally generated labyrinths to challenge corrupted heroes and demonic lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/48f4bbe93a2cd81f53e6dd47f24b7711.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/48f4bbe93a2cd81f53e6dd47f24b7711.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/48f4bbe93a2cd81f53e6dd47f24b7711.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beauty of Precision</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat prioritizes tactical mastery over frenetic combos. Parry, dodge, and execute Ethereal Dash to evade attacks, then counter with lethal strikes. Every decision\u2014timing, resource allocation, and positioning\u2014deepens the strategic depth of encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bound by Souls, Empowered by the Dead</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Companion system offers diverse combat strategies, featuring four distinct spectral allies: Swordsman, Ranger, Guardian, and Rogue. Harness their abilities to phase through obstacles, ambush foes from the netherworld, or evade fatal blows by shifting dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corrupted Legends Await</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bosses twisted by malevolent soul energy\u2014fallen lords, once-noble knights, primordial demons, and entities lurking in the dimensional void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanctuary at the Edge of Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the borderland camp between worlds, gather spectral allies, forge weapons tainted with demonic blood, stockpile resources, and piece together the truth behind calamity through fragmented dialogues. Will you redeem your comrades\u2019 souls or remain stuck between life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe Torch\u2019s light reveals no path to salvation, only the shadow of a gamble: as spectral forces tear through demonic throats, the wielder\u2019s name may yet become another epitaph on the Covenant Stone.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Netherworld Covenant</strong> is a <i>dark fantasy 3D isometric action roguelike</i> centered on <i>precision combat</i> and <i>Soul Companion</i> powers to deliver a hardcore, strategically rich experience. Control the survivor of a catastrophic disaster, wielding the Nether Lantern\u2014a forbidden artifact bridging the mortal realm and the netherworld\u2014to forge pacts with the souls of deceased allies. Venture into procedurally generated labyrinths to challenge corrupted heroes and demonic lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/48f4bbe93a2cd81f53e6dd47f24b7711.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/48f4bbe93a2cd81f53e6dd47f24b7711.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/48f4bbe93a2cd81f53e6dd47f24b7711.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beauty of Precision</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat prioritizes tactical mastery over frenetic combos. Parry, dodge, and execute Ethereal Dash to evade attacks, then counter with lethal strikes. Every decision\u2014timing, resource allocation, and positioning\u2014deepens the strategic depth of encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bound by Souls, Empowered by the Dead</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Companion system offers diverse combat strategies, featuring four distinct spectral allies: Swordsman, Ranger, Guardian, and Rogue. Harness their abilities to phase through obstacles, ambush foes from the netherworld, or evade fatal blows by shifting dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corrupted Legends Await</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bosses twisted by malevolent soul energy\u2014fallen lords, once-noble knights, primordial demons, and entities lurking in the dimensional void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanctuary at the Edge of Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the borderland camp between worlds, gather spectral allies, forge weapons tainted with demonic blood, stockpile resources, and piece together the truth behind calamity through fragmented dialogues. Will you redeem your comrades\u2019 souls or remain stuck between life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.poster.avif?t=1755238701\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.webm?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.mp4?t=1755238701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe Torch\u2019s light reveals no path to salvation, only the shadow of a gamble: as spectral forces tear through demonic throats, the wielder\u2019s name may yet become another epitaph on the Covenant Stone.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In the abyss where the mortal realm and netherworld intertwine, become a warrior wielding the power of the Nether Lantern to fight along with the fallen souls. With hardcore, soulslike action and intriguing roguelike builds, shatter the cursed barriers and unveil the truth woven from blood and soul.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cTransforming the core action RPG experience from games like Diablo or Path of Exile into a roguelike might sound very difficult. Yet Netherworld Covenant is a game that manages to successfully do that and even better\u201d<br>SoftPedia<br><br>\u201cNetherworld Covenant captures the feeling of a Dark Souls game in both its grim worldbuilding and presentation, as well as its fast-paced, reflex-demanding combat mechanics. The game can easily make you feel punished or supremely powerful based on your build, playstyle, and mastery of its mechanics.\u201d<br>Try Hard Guides<br><br>\u201cNetherworld Covenant est clairement le type d\u2019acc\u00e8s anticip\u00e9 que j\u2019appr\u00e9cie : une vraie proposition, un contenu day one cons\u00e9quent, une production optimis\u00e9e et un un plan de vol d\u00e9j\u00e0 en partie annonc\u00e9.\u201d<br>IGN France<br>",
